    "description": {
      "value": "<p>One of the easiest ways to propel your stardom is to associate yourself with power, whether you're playing a legendary hero from history or promoting your own modern myth. When you @UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.actions.Item.o8lqmFexiwcaLpu3]{Set the Spotlight} on yourself, you can @UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.actions.Item.ttL2TstfSqOyzCd2]{Cast a Role} to apply the epic role to yourself as a free action. As long as you are in a spotlight with the epic role, you can manifest hardlight effects as special attacks, gaining the SFX ranged unarmed attack that deals 1d4 bludgeoning damage with a range increment of 30 feet and the agile trait.</p>",
